Chosen LPs

1. Customer Obsession - Focus on solving for customer needs and maintaining trust. Show how you prioritized customers in decision-making.
2. Ownership - Demonstrate taking responsibility beyond your role, thinking long-term, and driving results without excuses.
3. Earn Trust - Show open communication, humility, candid feedback, and building relationships based on respect.
4. Dive Deep - Describe how you investigate details thoroughly, audit work, and make data-driven decisions.
5. Have Backbone; Disagree and Commit - Explain how you respectfully challenge decisions, stand firm when needed, and fully commit once a decision is made.
6. Deliver Results - Highlight your focus on key deliverables, overcoming obstacles, and achieving timely, quality outcomes.
7. Bias for Action - Emphasize taking calculated risks quickly, avoiding paralysis by analysis, and making decisions with available data.
8. Are Right, A Lot - Highlight examples of using good judgment, seeking diverse perspectives, and challenging your own beliefs.
9. Learn and Be Curious - Share how you actively pursue new knowledge, have a growth mindset, and apply learning to improve outcomes.
10. Hire and Develop the Best - Talk about identifying talent, mentoring others, raising team standards, and fostering growth.

